Add-T30Row -Label 'gate (f6g) CONTROL over seven ledgers with no null-result line -- (a), (b), (c), (c2), (c3), (f11), (f13): three PERMITS and four refusals -- this tree''s CLI and the CLI before this cure (the synthetic base base-700e19e5-s08, held to its sha256) give the same exit code and byte-identical output' -Ok $t30rowOk -Reading ("base blob sha256 $t30gBaseSha (pinned $t30BaseCliSha); identical $t30gSame of 7; differing: $(if ($t30gDiffer.Count) { $t30gDiffer -join ', ' } else { 'none' }); $($t30gCodes -join '; ')") -Max 1600

# --- THE TRANSCRIPTION TOOL, CHECK-ONLY. It needs a manifest to exist; an empty one is written only now,
