Add-T30Row -Label 'transcribe (f6b) the BARE-ID path over seven ledgers with no null-result line -- (a), (b), (c), (e1), (e4), (f11), (f13): 4 that exit 0, 3 that STOP with no traceback -- this tree''s tool and the tool before this cure (the s08 base) give the same exit code, byte-identical stdout and byte-identical stderr' -Ok $t30rowOk -Reading ("base blob sha256 $t30pBaseSha (pinned $t30BasePySha); identical $t30bSame of 7; exit 0: $t30bZero; STOP: $t30bStop; $($t30bFaces -join '; ')") -Max 1600

