$t52BothRun = Invoke-T52Census -Prefix 'fx-u-'
Add-T52Row -Label '(k) FALSIFIER the same verdict''s bytes under a hook stop''s name in one folder and a `hand-tee-` name in the next: counted ONCE, as the first copy says -- 1 verdict copy in 2 folders, ONE row, a hook stop, HAND TEES 0 -- the contradiction SAID in one FINDING line, and its 79 s in NO sum: SECONDS SAVED 0 s over 0; exit 1' `
