         (Test-T52Table -Run $t52BothRun -Rows @($t52BothHook.row)) -and (@(Get-T49Lines -Run $t52BothRun -Head 'FINDING: ').Count -eq 1) -and $t52BothHook.row.EndsWith('ON DISK, EQUAL; 79 s |')) `
