          "`n      WHAT THIS MEMBER DOES NOT CLAIM: that any verdict here is the evaluator's own bytes -- every one is SYNTHETIC, written in its line forms; that a`n" +
          "        prefix no folder starts with is refused or remarked; that an UNREAD stop is a finding -- it is counted, and the exit does not move; that the`n" +
